            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A battery block moving assembly for handling and manipulation with a battery block is described. The battery block moving assembly includes a trolley, a platform, a lift mechanism and a battery block moving mechanism. The battery block moving mechanism is coupled to the platform and configured to transfer the battery block from/to the platform.</p>
